5.0.4-rc0
---------
* implement pre-publishing DNSSEC signature gatekeeper to refuse future-dated or expired signatures before modifying PowerDNS (RFC 6781)
* fix silent fallback in OutputUpdate that allowed inserting plain unsigned records into DNSSEC-signed zones when signing parameters could not be retrieved
* re-sign SOA RRset with valid RRSIG when UPDATE_SOA is applied to DNSSEC-signed zones

5.0.3
-----
* upgrade build and runtime to Java 21 and Gradle 9.5.1 (#329)
* update dependencies: mysql-connector-j 9.3, jOOQ 3.18, HikariCP 6, BouncyCastle 1.80, JNA 5, Log4j 2.26 with SLF4J 2
* replace jcenter with Maven Central and migrate to com.gradleup.shadow plugin
* enforce UTC session timezone in JDBC connection pool (forceConnectionTimeZoneToSession=true) to match DIM's TIMESTAMP handling
* resolve class naming clash between org.xbill.DNS.Record and java.lang.Record
* add OBS RPM packaging specifications for Oracle Linux 9/10 (offline build support with pre-warmed Gradle/Maven cache)
* ensure configuration files in /etc/dim are readable by pdns-output service user
* dim-testsuite: add containerized test execution with multi-timezone dnssec and dnssec-diff validation against PowerDNS 5.0

4.0.0
-----
* initial pdns-output release running on Java 8
